From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: domicile CI <ci@domicile.invalid>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: screen casts see the pointer everywhere

A cast of a monitor showed no pointer over the shell's page or a browser
window. The compositor hears the pointer only over a window, from the
shell.

- `StartDeskPointer` (`chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_desk_pointer.cc`)
  observes aura's mouse moves and drags, in the shell page's CSS pixels.
- It tells `DeskPointer` (`components/domicile/browser/desk_pointer.cc`),
  and each control channel sends the compositor `desk_pointer`.
- Started in `PostBrowserStart`, beside `StartDeskActivity`.

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium; the engine
job builds it on `crux`.
---
 chrome/browser/chrome_browser_main.cc | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_main.cc b/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_main.cc
index f7d7fa1..dd112ac 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_main.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/chrome_browser_main.cc
@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_command_socket.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_desk.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_desk_activity.h"
+#include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_desk_pointer.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_file_dialogs.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/domicile/domicile_shell_windows.h"
 #include "components/domicile/browser/desktop_prefs.h"
@@ -1786,6 +1787,10 @@ void ChromeBrowserMainParts::PostBrowserStart() {
   // input rather than any page's.
   domicile::StartDeskActivity();
 
+  // Domicile's engine fork: every pointer move, to the compositor's screen
+  // casts, which hear the pointer only over a window. Here for the same reason.
+  domicile::StartDeskPointer();
+
   for (auto& chrome_extra_part : chrome_extra_parts_) {
     chrome_extra_part->PostBrowserStart();
   }
